WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.067 line:92%
-I want to talk about "Ant-Man,"

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:02.335 align:start size:94% position:6%
'cause I'm very
excited about this.

00:00:02.335 --> 00:00:03.303 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I've known you
for a long time.

00:00:03.303 --> 00:00:04.504 align:start size:94% position:6%
I feel like I know
a lot of things about you.

00:00:04.504 --> 00:00:08.808
I did not know this, that you
are a co-owner of a candy shop.

00:00:08.808 --> 00:00:10.744 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
-This is not a joke.

00:00:10.744 --> 00:00:11.678 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-This is not a joke.

00:00:11.678 --> 00:00:16.016 align:start size:94% position:6%
I am co-owner of a candy store
called Samuel's Sweet Shop,

00:00:16.016 --> 00:00:17.250 align:start size:94% position:6%
in Rhinebeck, New York.
-Okay.

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:20.520
-And I own this candy store
with Jeffrey Dean Morgan.

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:22.622 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Who's a fantastic actor.
-Great actor.

00:00:22.622 --> 00:00:24.824 align:start size:94% position:6%
Plays Negan
on "The Walking Dead."

00:00:24.824 --> 00:00:25.925 size:81% position:41% line:92%
-"Walking Dead," yeah.

00:00:25.925 --> 00:00:27.761 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And another guy
named Andy Ostroy.

00:00:27.761 --> 00:00:29.562 align:start size:94% position:6%
We all kind of
live around there.

00:00:29.562 --> 00:00:31.598 align:start size:94% position:6%
And we --
I brought you something.

00:00:31.598 --> 00:00:33.433 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.
I'm so excited.

00:00:33.433 --> 00:00:37.070 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So, we have lots of old...
-Old candy.

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:39.239 align:start size:94% position:6%
-...kind of fun candy.
-Great.

00:00:39.239 --> 00:00:41.174 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And then, there's another --
There's a woman

00:00:41.174 --> 00:00:45.612 align:start size:94% position:6%
named Donna Weber
who makes these treats for us.

00:00:45.612 --> 00:00:51.584
And she was so nice to put
my face on a Rice Krispie treat.

00:00:51.584 --> 00:00:52.585 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. Right over there.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:52.585 --> 00:00:56.456
Or Jeff on a Rice Krispie treat.
-Okay, there you go.

00:00:56.456 --> 00:00:57.757 align:start size:94% position:6%
So there you go.
There's Jeffrey.

00:00:57.757 --> 00:00:59.859 align:start size:94% position:6%
All right, so --
-And then, there's Andy,

00:00:59.859 --> 00:01:04.097 align:start size:94% position:6%
who you can see,
he's not really famous.

00:01:04.097 --> 00:01:07.067
He's just the other guy.
-Okay, go over there, yeah.

00:01:07.067 --> 00:01:10.503 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
All right.

00:01:10.503 --> 00:01:13.706 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And they don't really
sell that much,

00:01:13.706 --> 00:01:15.175 align:start size:94% position:6%
so I brought you
a bunch of Andy's.

00:01:15.175 --> 00:01:18.111 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay, got it.
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:18.111 --> 00:01:19.913 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Yeah.

00:01:19.913 --> 00:01:21.948 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And, um...

00:01:21.948 --> 00:01:23.883 align:start size:94% position:6%
You can tell --
Here, give it a shot.

00:01:23.883 --> 00:01:24.818 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Andy is delicious.

00:01:24.818 --> 00:01:27.153 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:27.153 --> 00:01:29.756 size:84% position:42%
-Um, now, do people,
when they first see it,

00:01:29.756 --> 00:01:31.257 align:start size:94% position:6%
because he's next
to you and Jeffrey,

00:01:31.257 --> 00:01:32.459 line:92%
do they go, "What's he in?"

00:01:32.459 --> 00:01:36.596
They must assume he's an actor.
-Uh, I don't know.

00:01:36.596 --> 00:01:38.431 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:38.431 --> 00:01:41.434 align:start size:94% position:6%
But...
-Is he delicious?

00:01:41.434 --> 00:01:43.536 align:start size:94% position:6%
-He's delicious!
-Now, quality-wise --

00:01:43.536 --> 00:01:47.674
-I'm gonna take a bite out of
Andy and a sip out of you.

00:01:47.674 --> 00:01:50.176 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:50.176 --> 00:01:54.414 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I've never heard anybody --
Thank you so much.

00:01:54.414 --> 00:01:58.251 align:start size:94% position:6%
So -- So this is your second
"Ant-Man" film.

00:01:58.251 --> 00:02:00.520 line:92%
Where does this one pick up?

00:02:00.520 --> 00:02:03.723 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, after --
Oh, wow.

00:02:03.723 --> 00:02:05.625 align:start size:94% position:6%
Now I've got Andy
caught in my teeth.

00:02:05.625 --> 00:02:07.327 line:92%
-Yeah, that was a mistake.

00:02:07.327 --> 00:02:09.696 line:92%
-I'll keep that joke going.

00:02:09.696 --> 00:02:11.731 align:start size:94% position:6%
It picks up,
I'm under house arrest,

00:02:11.731 --> 00:02:15.468
because if you remember at
the end of the "Civil War"...

00:02:15.468 --> 00:02:16.603 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Mm-hmm.

00:02:16.603 --> 00:02:18.171 align:start size:94% position:6%
-...all the Avengers
are fighting,

00:02:18.171 --> 00:02:23.343
and then, I get caught, and
I get put under house arrest.

00:02:23.343 --> 00:02:24.811 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Right.

00:02:24.811 --> 00:02:27.947 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That is why
I'm not in "Infinity War."

00:02:27.947 --> 00:02:28.648 size:78% position:39% line:92%
People have asked me.

00:02:28.648 --> 00:02:30.984 size:84% position:42%
-'Cause your character
was under house arrest.

00:02:30.984 --> 00:02:32.852 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:32.852 --> 00:02:34.420 size:78% position:39% line:92%
-And they couldn't --

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:37.490 size:81% position:41%
They couldn't plot you
out of house arrest?

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:39.792 align:start size:94% position:6%
In all the things
that they figure ways out of

00:02:39.792 --> 00:02:40.760 size:84% position:42% line:92%
in a Marvel universe...

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:42.929 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, no,
he's got to stay inside.

00:02:42.929 --> 00:02:43.596 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:43.596 --> 00:02:45.832 align:start size:94% position:6%
But, uh, yes,
I'm under house arrest,

00:02:45.832 --> 00:02:49.002 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I've kind of put
Hank and Hope --

00:02:49.002 --> 00:02:51.371 align:start size:94% position:6%
they're not talking to me,
it's --

00:02:51.371 --> 00:02:52.305 line:92%
We're a little bit at odds.

00:02:52.305 --> 00:02:55.642
-So, this is interesting,
'cause you co-wrote this script.

00:02:55.642 --> 00:02:57.810 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Right.
-Now, I have a lot of people

00:02:57.810 --> 00:03:00.847 align:start size:94% position:6%
who are stars
of the Marvel films here,

00:03:00.847 --> 00:03:03.283
and a lot of times,
they are limited by, of course,

00:03:03.283 --> 00:03:05.652 align:start size:94% position:6%
what they can say,
and, also, they're limited

00:03:05.652 --> 00:03:07.320 line:92%
by design as far as knowing

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:08.321 align:start size:94% position:6%
what's gonna happen next
in the universe.

00:03:08.321 --> 00:03:10.356 align:start size:94% position:6%
Did you have to get more
information than most of them

00:03:10.356 --> 00:03:11.691
because you were actually
working on the script?

00:03:11.691 --> 00:03:14.093 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
And it's terrifying to know --

00:03:14.093 --> 00:03:18.264 align:start size:94% position:6%
to have these secrets,
to know some of these things.

00:03:18.264 --> 00:03:19.933 align:start size:94% position:6%
I feel a lot of pressure.
-Mm-hmm.

00:03:19.933 --> 00:03:22.035 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But I also feel very
privileged, because, like,

00:03:22.035 --> 00:03:25.438
I knew about that "Infinity War"
before it was gonna happen.

00:03:25.438 --> 00:03:27.106 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You knew
you weren't gonna be in it?

00:03:27.106 --> 00:03:27.941 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-I knew --

00:03:27.941 --> 00:03:30.243 align:start size:94% position:6%
By the way, people say,
"infinity War,"

00:03:30.243 --> 00:03:31.010 line:92%
I go, "I guess we'll see."

00:03:31.010 --> 00:03:32.745 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's like,
"I know I'm not in it."

00:03:32.745 --> 00:03:33.279 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:33.279 --> 00:03:36.883
However -- However, people
have asked me about this one,

00:03:36.883 --> 00:03:39.719 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
and, uh...this --

00:03:39.719 --> 00:03:42.855
I don't know if I'm supposed
to say this, but I'll say it.

00:03:42.855 --> 00:03:45.858
It happens kind of concurrently.
-Got it.

00:03:45.858 --> 00:03:47.327 line:92%
-And it's very important,

00:03:47.327 --> 00:03:49.362 align:start size:94% position:6%
because it doesn't exist
in a vacuum.

00:03:49.362 --> 00:03:51.297 align:start size:94% position:6%
You have to stay
through the end,

00:03:51.297 --> 00:03:52.599 line:92%
because when you see this thing,

00:03:52.599 --> 00:03:55.301 align:start size:94% position:6%
through those
post-credit scenes,

00:03:55.301 --> 00:03:57.036 align:start size:94% position:6%
there's some
mind-blowing stuff in there

00:03:57.036 --> 00:03:59.305 align:start size:94% position:6%
that kind of
ties into "Infinity War."

00:03:59.305 --> 00:04:02.175 align:start size:94% position:6%
And it's --
I think I messed up.

00:04:02.175 --> 00:04:03.910 size:78% position:39%
I think I messed up.
-You think you mess--

00:04:03.910 --> 00:04:07.380 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think --
[ Applause ]

00:04:07.380 --> 00:04:08.915 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't know how
that could mess up, though,

00:04:08.915 --> 00:04:10.450
because I would only think
that would make more people

00:04:10.450 --> 00:04:13.319
see the movie,
which I feel like's the endgame.

00:04:13.319 --> 00:04:14.921 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You know what?
You're right.

00:04:14.921 --> 00:04:16.990 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

